he same\n86\t  surfaces and shares the same detection scan as the remediation work —\n87\t  extracting it would duplicate the scan across epics and leave the remediated\n88\t  surfaces unguarded (shared-surface enforcement rule).\n89\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bfb40571d500dae6","agent_id":"adf1730c530c0209a","session_id":"177f2182-dcad-4f2f-b1fd-9c1f9eb2a18a","uuid":"24b6c2e5-4e18-4eaf-8051-d961aa04c408","timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:21:58.203Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-81b7b3ecac0bb85c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
